<BaseLayout title="About — Tensorium" description="A small, open project for building intuition about machine learning.">
  <article class="concept-page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
    <h1>Understanding comes first.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tensorium is an open atlas of machine learning concepts, designed to make room for the ideas themselves.</p>
    <h2>A small beginning</h2>
    <p>This first edition establishes the reading experience with a gradient descent introduction. Interactive experiments and more concepts are next.</p>
    <h2>Made to be explored</h2>
    <p>Each concept will connect an intuitive explanation, a visual experiment, and the mathematics behind it. Pages are designed for a phone as carefully as a larger screen.</p>
    <h2>Built in the open</h2>
    <p>Ideas, corrections, and contributions are welcome on <a href="https://github.com/jipijipi/tensorium">GitHub</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
